# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IVNV — ivnvmusic.com
#
# Astro 7 + Tailwind 4 app under src/. `npm.cmd run build` writes dist/, which is
# published by the GitHub Actions Pages workflow. The legacy root static site is
# still live until the Pages source is switched; do not delete it before the
# `pre-astro` tag exists.
#
# Do NOT add Jekyll entries (_site/, .jekyll-cache/, Gemfile.lock). See AGENTS.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS / file explorer ------------------------------------------------
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Linux
.directory
.fuse_hidden*

